,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] State the explicit back-out: reverting the `DEFAULT_SUITE_MARKS` branch, the conftest auto-marker, and the pyproject marker restores the full macOS default suite (a pure config revert, no data migration).","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5a","T5e"],"criteria":["T4"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.7,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["The change alters gate behavior: macOS `DEFAULT_SUITE_MARKS` shifts from full default suite to `platform_compat and not external`.","No back-out/rollback sentence appears in Approach or Scope."],"finding":"This is an explicit, justified behavior change to the Verified Gate (macOS no longer runs the full default suite), but the plan states no rollback/back-out mechanism. The change is config-reversible, yet the reversibility is not called out.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fa1da663aa7f48884","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach / Scope","norm_id":"nef9750ad7c56e474","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A post-merge macOS regression escapes; on-call needs the fastest safe revert path stated up front."],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"Add one line to Approach: 'Rollback: revert the _build-and-test.yml macOS branch to `not integration and not external` (plus optionally the conftest/pyproject additions) to restore full macOS breadth — no data or schema migration.'","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2857,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justifi